{"parentUuid":"e107b32e-b585-48fb-b646-992b2c155c6f","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a06de6cc1a7950537","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_016C9P75u1JBh1hXnB7dpbLm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016jrnpw5X5jFRnwdRGMw2hk","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"\"Glucose\" \"MapleSAT\" \"Lingeling\" SAT solver 2024 2025 still maintained"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6648,"cache_read_input_tokens":28262,"output_tokens":213,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6648},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":213,"cache_read_input_tokens":28262,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6648,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6648,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaoowaWSB5nodgScj72bi","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"7db9e594-1e0b-4c72-9f3b-30a2d2899d8d","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:06:02.117Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"e107b32e-b585-48fb-b646-992b2c155c6f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"56e72661-9c70-4718-ac89-40d9fd2179ff","agentId":"a06de6cc1a7950537","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017r8MfpaSQq2WAhhnwTAWm2","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CP-SAT OR-Tools 9.10 9.11 release notes 2024 2025 improvements\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Release Notes | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/support/release_notes\"},{\"title\":\"Releases · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases\"},{\"title\":\"Kernel Dies: OR-Tools Code Crashes Jupyter Notebook · google/or-tools · Discussion #4289\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/4289\"},{\"title\":\"Release notes — Grokipedia\",\"url\":\"https://grokipedia.com/page/Release_notes\"},{\"title\":\"Google OR-Tools: CP-SAT Subset - Community - OCaml\",\"url\":\"https://discuss.ocaml.org/t/google-or-tools-cp-sat-subset/17885\"},{\"title\":\"10.11 Release Notes\",\"url\":\"https://documentation.lakesidesoftware.com/en/Content/Release%20Notes/Cloud/10_11%20Release%20Notes.htm?TocPath=Release+Notes%7CCloud%7CRelease+10.x%7C_____10\"},{\"title\":\"ortools · PyPI\",\"url\":\"https://pypi.org/project/ortools/\"},{\"title\":\"Security Advisories and Security Release Notes – Confluent Support Portal\",\"url\":\"https://support.confluent.io/hc/en-us/sections/360008413952-Security-Advisories-and-Security-Release-Notes\"},{\"title\":\"Top 10 Changelog & Release Notes Tools: Features, Pros, Cons & Comparison -\",\"url\":\"https://www.devopsschool.com/blog/top-10-changelog-release-notes-tools-features-pros-cons-comparison/\"},{\"title\":\"Cisco Room Series - Release Notes - Cisco\",\"url\":\"https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/collaboration-endpoints/spark-room-kit-series/products-release-notes-list.html\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about OR-Tools versions 9.10 and 9.11. Here's what I found:\n\n## OR-Tools Releases\n\nOR-Tools v9.11 and v9.10 have been released.\n\n### Key Improvements Found:\n\nThe search results contain some improvements mentioned, though the specific details for versions 9.10 and 9.11 are limited in the public release notes page. Some features and fixes that appear in recent OR-Tools releases include:\n\n**General Features:**\n- Improve presolve for int_abs, int_mod, int_prod and lin_max\n- Python: Improve numpy support\n\n**Platform Support:**\n- Add Rockylinux 9 support and Add Ubuntu 24.04 LTS support\n\n**Solver Enhancements:**\n- Add support for Gurobi 11\n- Improve XPRESS support\n\nFor more detailed release notes specific to versions 9.10 and 9.11, I recommend visiting the official OR-Tools release notes page at https://developers.google.com/optimization/support/release_notes or the GitHub releases page at https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases, where you can find comprehensive information about all changes and improvements for each version.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"e5c9befa-f012-444e-8ee6-793eba3d1ef7","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:06:07.518Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e107b32e-b585-48fb-b646-992b2c155c6f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"7db9e594-1e0b-4c72-9f3b-30a2d2899d8d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"56e72661-9c70-4718-ac89-40d9fd2179ff","agentId":"a06de6cc1a7950537","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016jrnpw5X5jFRnwdRGMw2hk","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"Glucose\" \"MapleSAT\" \"Lingeling\" SAT solver 2024 2025 still maintained\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"SAT solvers’ API (pysat.solvers) — PySAT 1.9.dev2 documentation\",\"url\":\"https://pysathq.github.io/docs/html/api/solvers.html\"},{\"title\":\"On the Glucose SAT Solver | International Journal on Artificial Intelligence Tools\",\"url\":\"https://www.worldscientific.com/doi/10.1142/S0218213018400018\"},{\"title\":\"On the Glucose SAT solver - Archive ouverte HAL\",\"url\":\"https://hal.science/hal-03299473/\"},{\"title\":\"On the Glucose SAT solver | Request PDF\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/322893605_On_the_Glucose_SAT_solver\"},{\"title\":\"On the Glucose SAT Solver | Semantic Scholar\",\"url\":\"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/On-the-Glucose-SAT-Solver-Audemard-Simon/9941d8555a7c1cca50a6558d090dbd59f4ee5dcc\"},{\"title\":\"On the Glucose SAT solver - Université d'Artois\",\"url\":\"https://univ-artois.hal.science/hal-03299473/\"},{\"title\":\"glucose: A SAT solver - Packages and Features\",\"url\":\"https://doc.sagemath.org/html/en/reference/spkg/glucose.html\"},{\"title\":\"pysat/pysat/solvers.py at master · pysathq/pysat\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/pysathq/pysat/blob/master/pysat/solvers.py\"},{\"title\":\"On the Glucose SAT Solver Gilles Audemard\",\"url\":\"https://univ-artois.hal.science/hal-03299473/document\"},{\"title\":\"Solvers | MapleSAT - GitHub Pages\",\"url\":\"https://maplesat.github.io/solvers.html\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I can provide you with information about these SAT solvers:\n\n## Current Status and Maintenance\n\nGlucose, MapleSAT, and Lingeling are all recognized and supported SAT solvers that are included in the PySAT framework, which indicates they remain relevant tools in the SAT solving community.\n\n**Glucose:** The set of novelties introduced with the SAT solver Glucose is now considered as a standard for practical SAT solving. The solver appears to be well-maintained within research frameworks.\n\n**MapleSAT:** MapleSAT has copyright dating to 2016 by Jia Hui Liang and Vijay Ganesh, and is based on modifications of Glucose, indicating it continues to be part of the solver ecosystem.\n\n**Lingeling:** Lingeling and its parallel version Plingeling remain referenced in academic comparisons with Glucose and Syrup, suggesting ongoing use in the research community.\n\n## Competitive Performance (2024)\n\nKissat is a non-incremental SAT solver, winner of the SAT Competition 2024, which suggests that while these classic solvers remain important, newer solvers like Kissat are achieving top performance in recent competitions.\n\nAll three solvers you mentioned appear to remain integrated into SAT solving frameworks and continue to be referenced in recent academic work, though the search results don't provide specific information about ongoing maintenance activities in 2024-2025.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"b238bd20-4784-44c0-b98b-cd87904f25fb","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:06:08.179Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7db9e594-1e0b-4c72-9f3b-30a2d2899d8d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"b238bd20-4784-44c0-b98b-cd87904f25fb","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a06de6cc1a7950537","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01XfFj67nCzxTigYjTynVYM6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have plenty of data now. Let me synthesize the recommendation.\n\n---\n\n# SAT Solver State of the Art (2024-2026) — 调研结论\n\n## 一、SAT Competition 2023/2024/2025 主线结果\n\n| 年份 | Main Sequential 冠军 | Parallel (64线程) 冠军 | 备注 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 2023 | Kissat | Mallob/SBVA portfolio | CaDiCaL 1.x |\n| **2024** | **kissat-sc2024** (PAR-2 2788, 解出306题) | **saoudi-painless-par2** (PAR-2 1397, 353题) | Kissat 横扫所有单线程 discipline 拿三金 |\n| **2025** | (Kissat 衍生主导) | **MallobSat** (3% 优势胜 Painless-PRS-Kissat) | MallobSat 首次拿下共享内存并行金牌 |\n\nVBS = Virtual Best Solver（理论上限），不是真实 solver。2024 单线程第二到第五全是 Kissat 的变体（hKis, BreakID-Kissat, Kissat_MAB-DC），**前五里没有非 Kissat 血统的解器**。\n\n## 二、主流 solver 横向对比\n\n| 名称 | 最新版本 | API/Learner | 并行 | 适合 | 我们的相关性 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **CaDiCaL** | 2.2 (2025) | **IPASIR-UP**（最强，可注入 propagator/learner，可删除外部 clause，支持 LIDRUP 增量证明）| 否（单线程）| 增量、长跑、cvc5 后端 | **极高** |\n| **Kissat** | 4.0.1 (2024-09) | 仅基础 IPASIR（**无 user propagator**）| 否 | 一次性单线程冲刺、SAT comp 短跑 | 中 |\n| **MallobSat** | 2025 NAPS | IPASIR-compatible | **原生分布式**，3072 核线性扩展 | 大规模并行、UNSAT 难题 | 中（24 线程是甜点） |\n| **Painless / D-Painless** | 2025 | 框架，套底层 solver | portfolio + clause sharing | 多核 CPU portfolio | 中 |\n| **Glucose / MapleSAT / Lingeling** | 几乎冻结 | 老 IPASIR | 老 portfolio | 已退出第一梯队 | 低，跳过 |\n| **ParaFROST** | 2024 仍发论文 | C++/CUDA | GPU 加速 inprocessing | 模型检查 | **低**——只加速 inprocess，不是端到端 GPU 求解，工业不可用 |\n\n## 三、关键判断\n\n1. **Kissat 是冲刺王，不是长跑王。** SAT comp 用 PAR-2 在 5000 秒（2024）和 1000 秒（2025 并行）超时下评。1-3 小时连续求解的 sweet spot 没有专门的赛道，但 Kissat 的设计哲学（aggressive restart、激进 inprocess）反而**对 1+ 小时的难 UNSAT 不一定友好**——它的 reduce 策略是为短跑调的。CaDiCaL 在长跑下更稳，cvc5、bitwuzla 用它做后端就是看中这个。\n\n2. **GPU SAT 在 2026 年依旧不工业可用。** ParaFROST 只在 inprocess 阶段（变量消除、subsumption）调 GPU，CDCL 主搜索还是 CPU。学术活跃但没有可替代 CP-SAT 的产品。**消费级显卡先放着。**\n\n3. **CP-SAT 和纯 SAT 不是同一类东西。** 你目前用 CP-SAT 是对的——10 万决策变量 + 强结构（all-different、cumulative）扔给纯 Kissat 等于把 LCG（Lazy Clause Generation）的工作丢掉，自己手写 encoding 反而退步。能赢 CP-SAT 的不是换 SAT 解器，而是更好的建模/分解（你们已经在做 Benders）。\n\n4. **真正能升级的方向是 IPASIR-UP**：把 CaDiCaL 2.2 当作 D 方案的底层，自己写 user propagator 注入业务约束（鬼影矩形、绑定）。这是**目前唯一允许跨次 incremental + 自定义传播**的稳定 API。\n\n## 四、对你们项目的推荐\n\n**第一备选：继续用 OR-Tools CP-SAT，不换。** 理由：\n- 10 万级变量 + 结构化（grid、cumulative、placement）正是 CP-SAT 的强项，纯 SAT 解器换上去会**更慢**而不是更快\n- 你们的 Benders 主框架不需要解器换，需要的是 master/binding/routing 子问题各自 hint 调优（lane B 已经在做）\n\n**第二备选（如果要做 D 方案 / 跨 wave incremental）：CaDiCaL 2.2 + IPASIR-UP**，**只在子问题层替换**，不替换主求解器。具体场景：\n- routing_subproblem 这种纯布尔 + 自定义路径约束的 piece，用 user propagator 比让 CP-SAT 编码再翻成 SAT 更直接\n- 跨 wave 的 nogood 学习，IPASIR-UP 的 LIDRUP 证明能保住 exactness\n\n**不推荐：Kissat 4.0.1 / MallobSat / ParaFROST。** Kissat 没 user propagator API，长跑不擅长；MallobSat 是分布式云架构，单机 24 线程发挥不出来还引入复杂度；ParaFROST 不工业可用。\n\n## 关键链接\n\n- [SAT Competition 2024 results](https://satcompetition.github.io/2024/results.html)\n- [SAT Competition 2024 medals 详情](https://cca.informatik.uni-freiburg.de/sat24medals/)\n- [Kissat 2024 描述论文（CaDiCaL/Gimsatul/Kissat 联合）](https://cca.informatik.uni-freiburg.de/papers/BiereFallerFazekasFleuryFroleyksPollitt-SAT-Competition-2024-solvers.pdf)\n- [CaDiCaL 2.0 CAV'24 论文](https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-65627-9_7)\n- [IPASIR-UP 论文 (SAT 2023)](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol271-sat2023/LIPIcs.SAT.2023.8/LIPIcs.SAT.2023.8.pdf)\n- [CaDiCaL GitHub (含 NEWS.md)](https://github.com/arminbiere/cadical)\n- [Kissat 4.0.1 release](https://github.com/arminbiere/kissat/releases/tag/rel-4.0.1)\n- [MallobSat 2025 KIT 公告](https://satres.kikit.kit.edu/news/2025-08-15-satcomp/)\n- [MallobSat 2025 NAPS 论文](https://satres.kikit.kit.edu/papers/2025-mallob-naps.pdf)\n- [Streamlining Distributed SAT Solver Design (SAT 2025)](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol341-sat2025/html/LIPIcs.SAT.2025.27/LIPIcs.SAT.2025.27.html)\n- [D-Painless (2025)](https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-90653-4_3)\n- [ParaFROST GitHub](https://github.com/muhos/ParaFROST)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2566,"cache_read_input_tokens":34910,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2566,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaooxLFDf794FGSVHcTZT","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"7fb4d058-06aa-45b9-8d36-f95b67493ec5","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:07:01.504Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
